### ::: We test here repository HTTP backend
### ::: Sections I to IV test the nominal operations
### :: Setup
### : Launch an minimal http server
### http-server
HTTP SERVER launched
### : Creation and populate the repository
### : we need to have repository layout at root as we use `opam admin` to create the archive
### rm -rf REPO
### <repo>
opam-version:"2.0"
### <packages/satu/satu.1/opam>
opam-version:"2.0"
### <packages/dua/dua.2/opam>
opam-version:"2.0"
### <packages/tiga/tiga.3/opam>
opam-version:"2.0"
### <packages/empat/empat.4/opam>
opam-version:"2.0"
### # We need this script to remove automatically embed timestamp in repo file
### # by 'opam admin index'
### <remove-timestamp.sh>
set -eu
cat > repo << EOF
opam-version:"2.0"
EOF
gzip -d index.tar.gz
tar rf index.tar repo
gzip index.tar
### : Creation of the archive to serve
### opam admin index
Generating urls.txt...
Generating index.tar.gz...
Done.
### sh remove-timestamp.sh
### : Clean the already default repository
### opam repo remove --all default
### opam repo --all | grep -v '^#'
